    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">Evaluate a valid <strong>postfix expression</strong> with integers and the operators <const>+</const>, <const>-</const> and <const>*</const>. Print its result. In postfix notation, each operator follows its two operands.<br><br><strong>Example:</strong> <const>3 -5 + 10 4 - *</const><br><strong>Stack: bottom &rarr; top</strong><br><br><const>3</const>: <strong>push</strong> <const>3</const> &rarr; <const>[3]</const><br><const>-5</const>: <strong>push</strong> <const>-5</const> &rarr; <const>[3, -5]</const><br><const>+</const>: <strong>pop</strong> <const>-5</const>, <const>3</const> &rarr; <const>3 + (-5) = -2</const> &rarr; <strong>push</strong> <const>-2</const> &rarr; <const>[-2]</const><br><const>10</const>: <strong>push</strong> <const>10</const> &rarr; <const>[-2, 10]</const><br><const>4</const>: <strong>push</strong> <const>4</const> &rarr; <const>[-2, 10, 4]</const><br><const>-</const>: <strong>pop</strong> <const>4</const>, <const>10</const> &rarr; <const>10 - 4 = 6</const> &rarr; <strong>push</strong> <const>6</const> &rarr; <const>[-2, 6]</const><br><const>*</const>: <strong>pop</strong> <const>6</const>, <const>-2</const> &rarr; <const>-2 * 6 = -12</const> &rarr; <strong>push</strong> <const>-12</const> &rarr; <const>[-12]</const><br><br><strong>Output:</strong> <const>-12</const><br><br><strong>Note:</strong> The first value popped is the right operand, so popping <const>4</const> before <const>10</const> gives <const>10 - 4</const>, not <const>4 - 10</const>.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> A postfix <var>expression</var>, with tokens separated by single spaces.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> The integer result of <var>expression</var>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">1 &le; number of tokens &le; 199<br>Each token is a decimal integer or one of <const>+</const>, <const>-</const>, <const>*</const>.<br>Every input integer and every intermediate result is between <const>-1000000</const> and <const>1000000</const>, inclusive.<br><var>expression</var> has at most 2000 characters.<br><var>expression</var> is valid and evaluates to exactly one integer.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">3 -5 + 10 4 - *</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">-12</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
